SUMMARY:Tricks-n-Treats Dog Festival
DESCRIPTION:Tricks-n-Treats Dog Festival\nOctober 25\, 2026\n11:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m\nOur Halloween dog festivities are back and bigger than ever! Join us for a day full of paw-some activities including a scavenger hunt\, pet-focused vendors\, a virtual costume contest\, and more! \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLocation\nTime\nGroup\nDescription\n\n\nBaker Event Lawn\n11:00 A.M. – 1:00 P.M.\nBayou Diesel\n\n\nCajun\, Zydeco\, and Old School Country\n\n\n\n\nBaker Event Lawn\n1:30 – 3:30 P.M.\nRhythm Rockets\n\n\nAmericana\, R&R\, Bues\, and Country\n\n\n\n\nArbor Eatery\n11:00 A.M. – 1:00 P.M.\nThe Jackson Town Ramblers\n\n\nBluegrass\, Swing\, and Gypsy Jazz\n\n\n\n\nArbor Eatery\n1:30 – 3:30 P.M.\nAsheville Junction\n\n\nBluegrass\, Americana\, and Country\n\n\n\n\n\nSponsored by:
